    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you say she should manage it, but it doesn't feel that way. it feels like every day i'm just draining her. it’s like i’m a parasite. sometimes i look at her and i just feel so much guilt that i’m the reason she’s so tired all the time. it feels like the only way to actually stop being a problem for her is to just... not be a problem anymore. like, isn't the most selfless thing you can do when you're just a drain on people to just let them go?",
